The form action that emails the contact looks up the tracked contact of the
request. When there is none (the visitor sends Do Not Track or Global
Privacy Control and tracking is blocked for the request), no email is sent.
This falls back to the contact saved with the submission.

--- a/docroot/app/bundles/EmailBundle/EventListener/FormSubscriber.php
+++ b/docroot/app/bundles/EmailBundle/EventListener/FormSubscriber.php
@@ -77,6 +77,11 @@
 
         $currentLead = $this->getCurrentLead($event->getActionFeedback());
 
+        // Use the submission's contact when the request has no tracked contact with an email.
+        if (empty($currentLead['email']) && ($submitted = $event->getSubmission()->getLead()) instanceof Lead) {
+            $currentLead = $submitted->getProfileFields();
+        }
+
